A simple western about the origin of the American Dream.

2
00:12:50,526 --> 00:12:56,526
First Cow is a drama, western film directed by Kelly Reichardt.

3
00:19:15,789 --> 00:19:21,789
In the 1820s, a taciturn loner and skilled cook travels west to Oregon
Territory, where he meets a Chinese immigrant also seeking his fortune.

4
00:25:41,052 --> 00:25:47,052
Soon the two team up on a dangerous scheme to steal milk from the wealthy
landowner’s prized Jersey cow—the first, and only, in the territory.

